    "created_at": "2026-05-18T00:00:00Z",
    "consolidation_adrs": ["ADR-0136", "ADR-0137", "ADR-0138"],
    "doc_class_note": "Not a per-product PRD (those use doc_class=Machine-Readable-Spec, spec_id=PRD-*). This is a six-to-one consolidation spec describing the foundry µservice's internal bounded-context decomposition. Excluded from product-prd-json gate by spec_id prefix. Per-bounded-context PRDs (if any) live under bc-sources/.",
    "purpose": "Foundry hosted-agent platform consolidation spec: one µservice with six internal bounded contexts (runtime, supervisor, eval, evidence, guardrails, providers). Consolidated from six prior µservice specs per ADR-0136. Supersedes specs/products/foundry/*.json (which never existed at consolidation time)."
  },
